Audio8 TTS SGLang Omni adapter
============================

Source: https://github.com/Edge0-AI/Audio8_TTS
Revision: 4eb54a69113eedc65677cbc09a30aee809bb39ee
Path: sglang_omni/adapter/sglang_omni/models/audio8_tts
License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE and NOTICE).

Local change: relocate adapter imports and pipeline factory paths from
sglang_omni.models.audio8_tts to xinference.thirdparty.audio8_tts.
The adapter does not modify the installed SGLang Omni package.

The TTS engine factory also accepts an explicit stream_enabled override so
Xinference can disable SSE queues independently of upstream environment settings.
